 "answer_verbatim": "A reasonable place to start is **GRC General Construction**: the BBB lists it as a Joplin-area remodel/general contractor with an **A+ rating**. It lists **(417) 499-7424** and **6812 Highway NN, Joplin**. Another option to check is **American Construction Inc.**, also listed by the BBB with an **A+ rating**; **(417) 781-6811**, **329 N. Main St., Joplin**.\n\nBBB ratings are only one signal, not a guarantee of workmanship. Before choosing, ask each contractor for a written, itemized estimate, proof of insurance, references for similar recent projects, and a clear payment schedule. Compare at least three bids, and avoid paying a large amount upfront. For a small repair, a handyman may be a better fit than a remodeling contractor.",
